  - The adversarial position (Qwen 4.0 Max) holds 1 HIGH and 1 MEDIUM, each reproduced through the real engine. The correctness position, ruled residual, holds 2 HIGH, 3 MEDIUM and 1 LOW.
  - Both are in .forge/results/8714aeba-08c0-4ba4-978e-a11e702a5de0-positions-{adversarial,correctness}.json. Read both WHOLE.
