- **M4 and M5:** every settled payload, whatever its member's name and whatever the store's contention, takes one bounded per-member path.

**Each finding names the writer it needs**, as one of:
- (i) a seat's result through the driver protocol;
- (ii) a recipe author;
- (iii) an engine path: a bug, contention or a crash;
- (iv) a direct write to the journal by a process of the account.
For (iv), say whether that writer could instead write a whole, consistent record that every check here admits. Each position reports findings with their severity and evidence, and does not state a verdict. The chief decides the outcome.

Every review position is READ-ONLY. Do not commit, reset, check out, build or write anywhere in this worktree, test files included. Scratch only under your own TMPDIR, in a `git archive HEAD | tar -x` copy. A copy that runs brokkr-cli's tests needs `git init` first, since those tests resolve the workspace through git.

